1
00:00:12,668 --> 00:00:15,938
(Jung Yong Hwa)

2
00:00:16,008 --> 00:00:19,008
(Hong Seung Hee)

3
00:00:19,078 --> 00:00:22,178
(Lee Yi Kyung)

4
00:00:23,448 --> 00:00:25,318
(Park Yu Na)

5
00:00:36,658 --> 00:00:39,898
(Oh! My Guard)

6
00:00:39,968 --> 00:00:41,468
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

7
00:00:41,528 --> 00:00:43,098
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

8
00:00:50,108 --> 00:00:51,678
We have received the unfortunate news...

9
00:00:51,738 --> 00:00:55,548
that actor Choi Gu is currently suffering from dementia.

10
00:00:55,608 --> 00:00:58,148
Actor Choi Gu debuted in 1993...

11
00:00:58,218 --> 00:01:00,948
through the Korean Broadcasting TV Literature Theater,

12
00:01:01,018 --> 00:01:04,188
and for about 30 years, he has been actively acting...

13
00:01:04,258 --> 00:01:06,458
across both television and theater stages.

14
00:01:07,588 --> 00:01:11,358
After his wife passed away from a chronic illness in 2019,

15
00:01:11,428 --> 00:01:13,798
and recently losing his only daughter,

16
00:01:13,868 --> 00:01:16,968
it appears that his condition has rapidly deteriorated.

17
00:01:17,038 --> 00:01:20,738
We here at Scoop TV also wish Choi Gu a speedy recovery.

18
00:01:21,938 --> 00:01:25,608
Moving on to our next story. Singer A has been booked...

19
00:01:25,678 --> 00:01:26,678
for habitual illegal gambling,

20
00:01:26,748 --> 00:01:29,478
drawing global attention.

21
00:01:29,548 --> 00:01:33,018
From around July 2017 to this past February,

22
00:01:33,018 --> 00:01:34,218
Singer A gambled 30 times...

23
00:01:34,218 --> 00:01:36,658
- with around one million dollars...
- What was that just now?

24
00:01:37,058 --> 00:01:39,628
(Episode 6)

25
00:01:39,628 --> 00:01:40,858
What was what?

26
00:01:40,928 --> 00:01:42,898
You know, like,

27
00:01:42,958 --> 00:01:46,328
pulling me in, hugging me, pressing down on my head...

28
00:01:50,438 --> 00:01:51,468
Do not tell me...

29
00:01:54,968 --> 00:01:56,778
You were worried I would eat it all by myself,

30
00:01:56,838 --> 00:01:57,938
so you followed me out here?

31
00:02:00,678 --> 00:02:04,748
Oh, looking at your shoes, that is exactly it.

32
00:02:04,818 --> 00:02:07,688
You must have been in a huge rush. How petty.

33
00:02:08,688 --> 00:02:10,318
What? Petty?

34
00:02:12,388 --> 00:02:16,298
Take that back. No, apologize. Who are you calling petty?

35
00:02:16,358 --> 00:02:19,428
My entire life, I have only ever heard...

36
00:02:19,498 --> 00:02:23,168
that I am bold and fearless. Apologise.

37
00:02:23,238 --> 00:02:27,468
Oh, is that so. Here you go. Sorry.

38
00:02:27,538 --> 00:02:29,208
Is that an apology?

39
00:02:29,268 --> 00:02:31,778
- An apology like that, I will...
- I refuse...

40
00:02:33,478 --> 00:02:35,048
- your refusal.
- Look at you.

41
00:02:35,048 --> 00:02:37,318
You must have learned how to apologize with your toes.

42
00:02:38,548 --> 00:02:42,248
You need a really good scolding to come to your senses.

43
00:02:42,318 --> 00:02:43,818
My thoughts exactly. Right back at you.

44
00:02:45,688 --> 00:02:46,888
Right back at you, too.

45
00:02:48,628 --> 00:02:51,358
She identifies herself with a drama character,

46
00:02:51,428 --> 00:02:54,598
and she cannot remember anything about her real self in reality?

47
00:02:54,698 --> 00:02:55,768
(A Few Days Ago)

48
00:02:55,828 --> 00:02:58,168
I would say it is a bit different from amnesia.

49
00:02:58,238 --> 00:03:01,338
It is a kind of psychological self-defence mechanism.

50
00:03:01,408 --> 00:03:02,938
If someone like that is around me,

51
00:03:03,008 --> 00:03:06,008
- would I be in a lot of danger?
- Well.

52
00:03:06,078 --> 00:03:08,308
The person themselves would be in more danger.

53
00:03:08,378 --> 00:03:10,948
If they are forced to face reality too suddenly...

54
00:03:13,048 --> 00:03:15,988
It would be like a ticking time bomb going off.

55
00:03:16,048 --> 00:03:18,318
It is best to let them realise it slowly on their own...

56
00:03:18,318 --> 00:03:21,988
so their self-defence mechanism does not collapse all at once.

57
00:03:22,058 --> 00:03:24,298
Otherwise, their mind will obviously become...

58
00:03:24,358 --> 00:03:25,558
a complete mess,

59
00:03:25,628 --> 00:03:27,968
and I am not sure how much of that shock...

60
00:03:28,028 --> 00:03:29,128
the brain can handle...

61
00:03:31,738 --> 00:03:33,738
To be more precise,

62
00:03:33,808 --> 00:03:35,968
we will need to do a brain scan...

63
00:03:37,908 --> 00:03:39,208
But who?

64
00:03:47,248 --> 00:03:48,748
How many cavities do you have?

65
00:03:50,458 --> 00:03:52,388
I run a pawnshop.

66
00:03:53,428 --> 00:03:54,828
I accept gold teeth.

67
00:03:57,798 --> 00:03:59,458
Except for the gold teeth,

68
00:04:01,628 --> 00:04:03,968
I will chew you all up.

69
00:04:10,478 --> 00:04:11,478
That is too much, too much.

70
00:04:19,178 --> 00:04:22,418
But why were you so angry earlier?

71
00:04:23,718 --> 00:04:26,018
Who is the one filled with anger these days?

72
00:04:32,198 --> 00:04:33,228
You.

73
00:04:35,798 --> 00:04:36,898
You do not trust me, do you?

74
00:04:40,538 --> 00:04:42,568
You think just having me...

75
00:04:42,638 --> 00:04:44,738
- is not enough, right?
- What are you talking about?

76
00:04:45,938 --> 00:04:46,978
Speak so I can understand.

77
00:04:47,048 --> 00:04:51,418
He did not look like he had soft muscles or weak bones.

78
00:04:51,478 --> 00:04:53,348
Just by looking at him.

79
00:04:53,418 --> 00:04:54,618
What, weak...

80
00:04:56,788 --> 00:04:57,788
Who?

81
00:05:04,298 --> 00:05:05,428
Am I someone...

82
00:05:06,928 --> 00:05:08,198
you do not need?

83
00:05:18,808 --> 00:05:19,808
Do not follow me.

84
00:05:23,948 --> 00:05:25,948
What do you mean, do not follow you?

85
00:05:26,018 --> 00:05:27,088
It is my house.

86
00:05:30,358 --> 00:05:32,418
What do you mean? Take down the article?

87
00:05:36,258 --> 00:05:37,658
He lost his wife.

88
00:05:39,868 --> 00:05:40,898
And recently,

89
00:05:42,098 --> 00:05:43,638
even his only daughter...

90
00:05:46,908 --> 00:05:49,508
They say his dementia worsened from the shock.

91
00:05:49,568 --> 00:05:51,008
The problem is that even now,

92
00:05:51,078 --> 00:05:53,178
he is going back and forth, and it is a mess.

93
00:05:53,248 --> 00:05:56,778
If he receives any more shock, he will be in real trouble.

94
00:06:00,248 --> 00:06:02,048
I did not know there was such a story.

95
00:06:05,218 --> 00:06:07,188
Still, because they worked on a drama together,

96
00:06:07,258 --> 00:06:09,058
our Tae Bong is helping him out.

97
00:06:14,098 --> 00:06:15,368
Um Tae Bong is loyal.

98
00:06:22,508 --> 00:06:24,238
I will have to take down the exclusive article about Choi Gu.

99
00:06:25,378 --> 00:06:27,478
The reporting was wrong.

100
00:06:27,548 --> 00:06:30,218
Yes, I will write a letter of apology.

101
00:06:30,278 --> 00:06:31,448
Sir...

102
00:06:33,518 --> 00:06:35,248
I will post that in the reporters' group chat.

103
00:06:35,318 --> 00:06:36,458
So that other places cannot cover it either.

104
00:06:43,328 --> 00:06:45,128
The issue with him has been well resolved.

105
00:06:47,428 --> 00:06:48,468
That is a relief.

106
00:06:52,998 --> 00:06:54,268
This is...

107
00:06:54,268 --> 00:06:56,038
not a sound coming from my mouth.

108
00:06:57,538 --> 00:06:58,708
It is a sound coming from my fist.

109
00:06:59,948 --> 00:07:01,678
Again...

110
00:07:01,748 --> 00:07:03,518
I can go right back to how I was.

111
00:07:03,578 --> 00:07:06,348
I came as the junior stylist.

112
00:07:11,888 --> 00:07:13,988
He really thinks I am not enough, that is what it is.

113
00:07:16,728 --> 00:07:17,728
Or,

114
00:07:19,698 --> 00:07:21,268
he just does not find me reliable anymore.

115
00:07:22,568 --> 00:07:25,138
That is right, that is it.

116
00:07:25,198 --> 00:07:27,108
Okay, I admit it.

117
00:07:27,168 --> 00:07:29,738
That I am not as agile as before,

118
00:07:29,808 --> 00:07:31,878
and that I cannot even kick properly.

119
00:07:31,938 --> 00:07:35,848
I admit all of that.

120
00:07:35,908 --> 00:07:39,018
- One.
- No way. I really feel like...

121
00:07:39,078 --> 00:07:40,448
I am going to die, Father.

122
00:07:40,518 --> 00:07:42,548
- Did you count that right?
- One is correct.

123
00:07:45,388 --> 00:07:49,588
Anyway, Um Tae Bong, you are the one person...

124
00:07:49,658 --> 00:07:53,698
- I will definitely protect.
- One.

125
00:07:53,768 --> 00:07:55,228
Why is it one again?

126
00:08:02,368 --> 00:08:04,308
So she is angry?

127
00:08:04,378 --> 00:08:06,648
- One.
- So that...

128
00:08:06,708 --> 00:08:08,578
- Three.
- she could be someone I need?

129
00:08:11,978 --> 00:08:13,748
I need to pee.

130
00:08:16,958 --> 00:08:18,358
That young lady...

131
00:08:19,358 --> 00:08:23,058
looks really nice when she smiles. Right? Tae Bong.

132
00:08:25,028 --> 00:08:26,028
Right.

133
00:08:29,168 --> 00:08:30,168
Sir...

134
00:08:32,468 --> 00:08:33,568
Sir?

135
00:08:37,008 --> 00:08:40,878
I really need to pee. Oh, it is urgent.

136
00:08:40,948 --> 00:08:42,248
It is urgent.

137
00:08:46,718 --> 00:08:47,748
Sir...

138
00:08:49,488 --> 00:08:50,958
Using the new car launch as an excuse,

139
00:08:51,018 --> 00:08:52,018
the shareholders' meeting was delayed...

140
00:08:52,088 --> 00:08:53,788
is spreading as a rumour.

141
00:08:53,858 --> 00:08:55,558
Since it directly affects the stock price,

142
00:08:55,628 --> 00:08:56,828
if it is delayed again,

143
00:08:56,898 --> 00:09:00,128
the shareholders will not just sit back.

144
00:09:00,198 --> 00:09:02,298
Oh, of course, the new car line is getting a good response,

145
00:09:02,368 --> 00:09:04,598
so the stock price has been rising more than before.

146
00:09:04,668 --> 00:09:06,538
Still, to put the false rumours to rest,

147
00:09:06,608 --> 00:09:08,208
do we not need to do something?

148
00:09:08,268 --> 00:09:09,268
False rumours?

149
00:09:09,338 --> 00:09:11,578
The rumours about the veiled heiress.

150
00:09:17,878 --> 00:09:19,078
The date for the shareholders' meeting will be...

151
00:09:19,148 --> 00:09:20,348
rescheduled soon.

152
00:09:24,188 --> 00:09:26,628
Wow, how experienced is this guy?

153
00:09:26,688 --> 00:09:29,228
The stock price went up with the new car launch,

154
00:09:29,288 --> 00:09:31,558
so he created a justification to increase...

155
00:09:31,628 --> 00:09:33,368
the votes for his reappointment at the shareholders' meeting.

156
00:09:33,428 --> 00:09:36,128
Do you know who is more anxious than the old tiger?

157
00:09:38,198 --> 00:09:42,138
- The fox with many secrets.
- Oh, please be careful.

158
00:09:42,208 --> 00:09:43,978
Seeing how he turned the once-powerful Chairman Wang...

159
00:09:44,038 --> 00:09:47,648
into a toothless tiger and forced him to step down,

160
00:09:47,708 --> 00:09:49,778
how scary of a person is he?

161
00:09:50,848 --> 00:09:54,548
- Toothless.
- No, more importantly, earlier,

162
00:09:54,618 --> 00:09:58,388
that rumour about the heiress. I have not heard it.

163
00:09:58,458 --> 00:09:59,458
Was there such a thing?

164
00:09:59,518 --> 00:10:01,728
If there is not one, we can just make one.

165
00:10:01,788 --> 00:10:02,788
Excuse me?

166
00:10:02,858 --> 00:10:05,428
That fox is definitely hiding something.

167
00:10:05,498 --> 00:10:07,528
A secret we do not know yet.

168
00:10:07,598 --> 00:10:09,168
A secret?

169
00:10:09,228 --> 00:10:10,498
Is there any secret...

170
00:10:10,568 --> 00:10:11,668
that does not come to light in this world?

171
00:10:13,098 --> 00:10:15,368
Does it not feel like something very interesting...

172
00:10:15,438 --> 00:10:16,438
is going to happen?

173
00:10:18,008 --> 00:10:21,978
When the heiress was mentioned, his eyes said it all.

174
00:10:24,678 --> 00:10:25,978
Eyes?

175
00:10:26,048 --> 00:10:29,318
When it comes to intimidating eyes, our chairman is on another level.

176
00:10:29,388 --> 00:10:32,818
Last time in the lobby, I made eye contact with him once,

177
00:10:32,888 --> 00:10:34,158
and I almost wet myself.

178
00:10:36,128 --> 00:10:38,398
Is that why the founder, Chairman Wang, disliked him?

179
00:10:38,458 --> 00:10:40,698
Because of those intimidating eyes.

180
00:10:40,768 --> 00:10:42,598
I heard he strongly opposed the marriage because of that.

181
00:10:42,668 --> 00:10:45,838
That is why he worked himself to death.

182
00:10:45,898 --> 00:10:47,808
To look good to his father-in-law. Right?

183
00:10:47,868 --> 00:10:50,508
Honestly, our company growing this much...

184
00:10:50,578 --> 00:10:52,808
is all thanks to the current Chairman Oh.

185
00:10:52,878 --> 00:10:54,308
Even if she is his own daughter,

186
00:10:54,378 --> 00:10:55,978
if the company is taken right out from under him,

187
00:10:56,048 --> 00:10:57,818
would he be pissed off or not?

188
00:10:57,878 --> 00:10:59,988
- He would be.
- Exactly.

189
00:11:00,048 --> 00:11:02,288
This is so annoying. What now?

190
00:11:02,348 --> 00:11:05,188
It splashed all over my clothes. Pay for my dry cleaning.

191
00:11:05,258 --> 00:11:07,558
Oh, it is just a little bit of water.

192
00:11:08,628 --> 00:11:10,828
Last week, you said you burned the roof of your mouth...

193
00:11:10,898 --> 00:11:13,368
and asked for medical bills. So annoying.

194
00:11:13,428 --> 00:11:16,098
She is a repeat offender. She is very famous for it.

195
00:11:16,168 --> 00:11:17,868
But if our heiress...

196
00:11:17,938 --> 00:11:20,508
is a pain like her, we are in big trouble.

197
00:11:27,808 --> 00:11:29,008
Oh, I will...

198
00:11:29,078 --> 00:11:30,248
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

199
00:11:31,248 --> 00:11:32,248
(Lunch Special Discount Event)

200
00:11:33,548 --> 00:11:35,348
- Let's go.
- Please go ahead.

201
00:11:45,798 --> 00:11:46,798
Oh my.

202
00:11:48,928 --> 00:11:50,768
What did you just do to me?

203
00:11:54,238 --> 00:11:55,638
I do not think we even touched.

204
00:11:55,708 --> 00:11:58,038
Then why is this on the floor?

205
00:12:11,488 --> 00:12:13,058
Come on, do something about it.

206
00:12:15,328 --> 00:12:16,328
Why should I?

207
00:12:17,628 --> 00:12:18,758
Are you asking because you do not know?

208
00:12:18,828 --> 00:12:20,728
Everyone is recognising me right now.

209
00:12:23,028 --> 00:12:26,138
Since you are so famous, are you billing me right now?

210
00:12:26,198 --> 00:12:27,968
What exactly are you billing me for in this situation?

211
00:12:28,038 --> 00:12:31,608
What are you talking about? Seriously, do something about this.

212
00:12:50,498 --> 00:12:53,058
The more I think about it, the less it's my issue.

213
00:12:53,128 --> 00:12:55,198
And why the sunglasses indoors?

214
00:13:03,908 --> 00:13:07,248
That is my business. What a total freak.

215
00:13:08,478 --> 00:13:09,748
Could he be an anti-fan?

216
00:13:15,148 --> 00:13:16,148
What is going on?

217
00:13:16,218 --> 00:13:18,518
You are actually volunteering to work out.

218
00:13:18,588 --> 00:13:19,888
Did you bring a camera crew or something?

219
00:13:21,188 --> 00:13:24,128
When you are not around to protect me from the stalker,

220
00:13:24,198 --> 00:13:26,628
- I have to protect my own body.
- You have Hong Du.

221
00:13:27,898 --> 00:13:28,998
I heard she is your secret bodyguard.

222
00:13:29,068 --> 00:13:31,838
- Su Dong told me.
- Gosh, that blabbermouth.

223
00:13:31,898 --> 00:13:33,638
And what happened at the store last time.

224
00:13:33,708 --> 00:13:35,168
Did you two already know each other?

225
00:13:35,238 --> 00:13:38,308
It is complicated. A little help?

226
00:13:38,378 --> 00:13:39,438
- Here.
- Oh, man.

227
00:13:41,248 --> 00:13:43,208
How complicated could it be...

228
00:13:43,278 --> 00:13:46,018
that you even lied to Hong Du about me being a stylist?

229
00:13:49,448 --> 00:13:51,158
Did she...

230
00:13:51,218 --> 00:13:52,888
catch you doing something wrong?

231
00:13:57,298 --> 00:13:59,098
What?

232
00:13:59,158 --> 00:14:01,468
Running, it is all about running.

233
00:14:01,528 --> 00:14:03,838
Whether it is a fan or a stalker,

234
00:14:03,898 --> 00:14:06,068
if you face a dangerous situation,

235
00:14:06,138 --> 00:14:08,338
you just have to run away.

236
00:14:08,408 --> 00:14:10,208
What does she have on you?

237
00:14:20,078 --> 00:14:21,588
- You punk.
- Hey, let go.

238
00:14:21,648 --> 00:14:23,218
I have been going easy on you lately...

239
00:14:23,288 --> 00:14:25,758
Hey, are you going to talk? Are you really not going to talk?

240
00:14:25,818 --> 00:14:27,558
What was that about earlier? Gosh.

241
00:14:28,588 --> 00:14:29,988
Tap.

242
00:14:35,098 --> 00:14:36,128
When are you going to tell me?

243
00:14:39,568 --> 00:14:41,268
Idiot.

244
00:14:41,338 --> 00:14:43,908
Do you think I'm blind? That Hong Du is a fake.

245
00:14:46,238 --> 00:14:49,078
You think a swordsman wouldn't recognise another swordsman?

246
00:14:49,148 --> 00:14:51,278
Hong Du is obviously not one of us.

247
00:14:52,848 --> 00:14:54,148
You're like a ghost.

248
00:14:55,718 --> 00:14:59,518
When you accepted Hong Du as your bodyguard, well,

249
00:14:59,588 --> 00:15:02,288
you must have had a good reason. But...

250
00:15:03,388 --> 00:15:04,858
This isn't right.

251
00:15:04,928 --> 00:15:07,568
You're in danger too. And I can't always be by your side.

252
00:15:28,148 --> 00:15:30,688
- Since when have you been here?
- I just got here.

253
00:15:30,758 --> 00:15:32,358
CEO Park told me you were here.

254
00:15:34,258 --> 00:15:35,758
All alone without even telling me?

255
00:15:35,828 --> 00:15:37,498
Just...

256
00:15:37,558 --> 00:15:39,658
I thought you were spending time with your father.

257
00:15:40,668 --> 00:15:41,698
Are you avoiding me?

258
00:15:42,868 --> 00:15:44,038
Me?

259
00:15:44,798 --> 00:15:45,998
No.

260
00:15:46,068 --> 00:15:47,068
Look.

261
00:15:48,068 --> 00:15:50,308
You're not even making eye contact right now.

262
00:15:50,378 --> 00:15:52,678
I never look at anyone for more than three seconds.

263
00:15:52,738 --> 00:15:54,178
I'm afraid I'll blind them.

264
00:15:57,778 --> 00:15:59,178
Do you really not need me?

265
00:16:00,488 --> 00:16:02,618
The bodyguard who protects you, you don't need me anymore...

266
00:16:03,718 --> 00:16:05,618
You should take it easy too.

267
00:16:05,688 --> 00:16:07,958
Don't risk your life for me.

268
00:16:16,568 --> 00:16:17,798
What does that mean?

269
00:16:19,238 --> 00:16:20,808
That's...

270
00:16:20,868 --> 00:16:21,968
my job.

271
00:16:38,488 --> 00:16:41,258
- So I'm Tae Bong's...
- I know.

272
00:16:41,328 --> 00:16:44,058
Um Tae Bong didn't trust me enough, so he called you.

273
00:16:44,128 --> 00:16:47,298
Then please take good care of Um Tae Bong.

274
00:16:51,598 --> 00:16:52,598
Excuse me...

275
00:16:53,708 --> 00:16:56,068
I need to catch this stalker or something.

276
00:17:00,978 --> 00:17:03,818
(Filming With Tae Bong)

277
00:17:10,188 --> 00:17:11,418
Where have you been?

278
00:17:11,488 --> 00:17:13,358
I made Tae Bong exercise a bit.

279
00:17:13,418 --> 00:17:16,488
Good job. If you help Tae Bong,

280
00:17:16,558 --> 00:17:18,398
I can relax too.

281
00:17:18,458 --> 00:17:19,498
What's this?

282
00:17:20,828 --> 00:17:22,528
Letters from that stalker.

283
00:17:22,598 --> 00:17:24,898
Without Tae Bong knowing, I'm going to catch this jerk.

284
00:17:27,368 --> 00:17:28,968
There are no customers.

285
00:17:29,038 --> 00:17:31,908
Yes. We had a whole war earlier,

286
00:17:31,978 --> 00:17:33,238
and now there's one person...

287
00:17:39,078 --> 00:17:41,318
When did they leave? That customer is strange.

288
00:17:41,388 --> 00:17:43,118
He just left last time too.

289
00:17:49,058 --> 00:17:51,998
Are you looking for them, or are you intentionally not looking?

290
00:17:52,058 --> 00:17:55,328
I have to move quietly, so it's just taking some time.

291
00:17:55,398 --> 00:17:56,398
More importantly,

292
00:17:57,738 --> 00:17:59,468
I want to know how you feel, Chairman.

293
00:18:02,838 --> 00:18:04,278
Are you looking for her...

294
00:18:04,338 --> 00:18:06,178
to get a memorandum of renunciation of management rights...

295
00:18:06,238 --> 00:18:07,478
before the shareholders' meeting, or...

296
00:18:09,248 --> 00:18:10,678
is it because you want to be a father to her...

297
00:18:10,748 --> 00:18:14,088
- even now?
- Even if she comes back,

298
00:18:14,148 --> 00:18:15,188
do you think...

299
00:18:16,648 --> 00:18:19,158
she could become someone who fits in at the company?

300
00:18:24,928 --> 00:18:27,728
You've watched her closer than anyone,

301
00:18:27,798 --> 00:18:29,568
so you'd know the answer better than me.

302
00:18:31,638 --> 00:18:33,368
What if...

303
00:18:33,438 --> 00:18:35,008
the young lady is changing?

304
00:18:39,578 --> 00:18:41,208
Are you hiding something from me?

305
00:18:47,618 --> 00:18:48,618
Come in.

306
00:18:57,898 --> 00:18:59,728
Right, you have something to report?

307
00:19:03,498 --> 00:19:05,998
I apologize. It wasn't the young lady.

308
00:19:07,608 --> 00:19:08,608
What?

309
00:19:28,328 --> 00:19:29,528
The young lady's whereabouts are still...

310
00:19:33,598 --> 00:19:34,598
Excuse me...

311
00:19:42,408 --> 00:19:44,908
Did you happen to find the person you were looking for?

312
00:19:48,408 --> 00:19:50,008
I'm Han Jung Woo from the Strategic Planning Team.

313
00:19:51,178 --> 00:19:54,988
I happened to overhear you in the chairman's office last time.

314
00:19:55,048 --> 00:19:56,848
I apologize.

315
00:19:56,918 --> 00:19:58,258
You must have misheard.

316
00:20:00,358 --> 00:20:01,358
I don't think so.

317
00:20:02,458 --> 00:20:04,228
I definitely heard it then.

318
00:20:06,358 --> 00:20:09,098
No. You misheard.

319
00:20:13,798 --> 00:20:16,608
If you make such a scary face,

320
00:20:16,668 --> 00:20:19,338
people might think you're threatening me right now.

321
00:20:21,178 --> 00:20:23,148
This makes me even more curious.

322
00:20:29,188 --> 00:20:31,518
You must have misunderstood something.

323
00:20:31,588 --> 00:20:33,118
- What I mean is...
- Actually...

324
00:20:34,228 --> 00:20:36,688
A car accident from a long time ago, I saw an article about it.

325
00:20:38,428 --> 00:20:39,528
(At the accident scene involving victim Wang Hui Yeon)

326
00:20:39,598 --> 00:20:40,968
(A car keychain was found.)

327
00:20:41,028 --> 00:20:42,028
(It did not seem to belong to her.)

328
00:20:42,098 --> 00:20:43,468
(No other occupants were reported.)

329
00:20:47,268 --> 00:20:48,538
Is it because of that?

330
00:20:52,078 --> 00:20:54,078
I got more curious about that person.

331
00:20:57,248 --> 00:20:58,248
That person?

332
00:20:59,248 --> 00:21:00,248
Yes.

333
00:21:01,088 --> 00:21:02,088
That person.

334
00:21:08,458 --> 00:21:10,288
It's late.

335
00:21:10,358 --> 00:21:11,358
I'll be going then.

336
00:21:17,198 --> 00:21:19,498
Han Jung Woo from the Strategic Planning Team.

337
00:21:25,778 --> 00:21:28,808
Yes, Chairman. I found out where she is.

338
00:21:28,878 --> 00:21:29,948
Yes, I'm heading up now.

339
00:21:31,848 --> 00:21:32,878
Secretary Kim Ji An.

340
00:21:37,388 --> 00:21:39,958
- The reason you wanted to see me...
- You should know.

341
00:21:41,128 --> 00:21:42,488
I was just...

342
00:21:42,558 --> 00:21:45,328
- doing what the chairman ordered...
- You also did things...

343
00:21:45,398 --> 00:21:48,698
the chairman didn't order. I know you dug into my background.

344
00:21:48,768 --> 00:21:50,898
Even the time before I came to the chairman's house.

345
00:21:52,668 --> 00:21:53,668
Yes.

346
00:21:55,668 --> 00:21:58,178
Then you'll understand quickly.

347
00:21:58,238 --> 00:22:01,848
Do the job the chairman ordered.

348
00:22:01,908 --> 00:22:03,008
Instead,

349
00:22:03,078 --> 00:22:05,048
the answer you report to the chairman...

350
00:22:05,118 --> 00:22:06,778
is already decided.

351
00:22:13,358 --> 00:22:14,988
I thought I was going to suffocate.

352
00:22:20,868 --> 00:22:21,868
Yes.

353
00:22:23,328 --> 00:22:25,298
It is today, right? The meeting with Um Tae Bong.

354
00:22:36,248 --> 00:22:37,948
With that ribbon around your neck today,

355
00:22:38,018 --> 00:22:40,788
you look exactly like a prince. Why did you tie it like a butterfly?

356
00:22:42,118 --> 00:22:43,118
What about Dong Seok?

357
00:22:43,188 --> 00:22:44,588
He said he had something to look into,

358
00:22:44,658 --> 00:22:46,088
so he cannot make it today.

359
00:22:46,158 --> 00:22:49,028
Are you really not taking Hong Du with you?

360
00:22:49,088 --> 00:22:50,388
She is a fake.

361
00:22:50,458 --> 00:22:53,298
Her name, her bodyguard skills, all fake.

362
00:22:53,358 --> 00:22:56,628
We managed to get by until now, but we cannot do this anymore.

363
00:22:58,198 --> 00:22:59,568
It is too dangerous for me.

364
00:22:59,638 --> 00:23:01,268
Right, you have a point,

365
00:23:01,338 --> 00:23:03,038
but if we are going to put on a Truman Show anyway...

366
00:23:05,008 --> 00:23:06,938
Hong Du, you were at home.

367
00:23:07,008 --> 00:23:09,148
- Where is Mr. Choi?
- He is sleeping.

368
00:23:09,208 --> 00:23:10,848
I see.

369
00:23:10,918 --> 00:23:13,218
Thank you for always taking care of my father.

370
00:23:13,278 --> 00:23:16,048
No, I am the one who is always thankful.

371
00:23:18,558 --> 00:23:20,588
But do I really not need to go with you?

372
00:23:23,128 --> 00:23:25,728
Yes. CEO Park is going with me.

373
00:23:27,098 --> 00:23:28,928
Still.

374
00:23:28,998 --> 00:23:30,768
If you go, you will just get in the...

375
00:23:34,368 --> 00:23:36,068
Anyway,

376
00:23:36,138 --> 00:23:37,908
stay home.

377
00:23:37,978 --> 00:23:39,078
Do not wander around.

378
00:23:49,348 --> 00:23:50,418
He is avoiding me again.

379
00:23:52,588 --> 00:23:53,988
This is not why I came here.

380
00:23:56,588 --> 00:23:58,198
When I woke up in the hospital,

381
00:23:59,798 --> 00:24:01,198
I should not have looked for him.

382
00:24:03,128 --> 00:24:04,138
It is Um Tae Bong.

383
00:24:07,468 --> 00:24:08,968
Yes.

384
00:24:09,038 --> 00:24:10,238
Yes, understood.

385
00:24:10,308 --> 00:24:11,878
Sorry, they said they will be right down.

386
00:24:11,938 --> 00:24:13,008
They asked us to wait here for a moment.

387
00:24:14,108 --> 00:24:15,978
Cha Hong Du.

388
00:24:16,048 --> 00:24:17,948
Whatever that woman's real name is,

389
00:24:19,018 --> 00:24:21,488
do you really not know? Her true identity?

390
00:24:21,548 --> 00:24:23,048
I do not know.

391
00:24:23,118 --> 00:24:24,118
I swear, I have no idea.

392
00:24:24,188 --> 00:24:26,118
She does not even know herself, so how would I know?

393
00:24:28,558 --> 00:24:31,158
I would say it is a bit different from amnesia.

394
00:24:31,228 --> 00:24:34,728
It is a kind of psychological self-defence mechanism.

395
00:24:36,798 --> 00:24:39,198
If it is self-defence,

396
00:24:39,268 --> 00:24:42,038
that means her life must have been really hard, right?

397
00:24:43,208 --> 00:24:44,338
Who knows.

398
00:24:44,408 --> 00:24:45,678
Man, that Nam Goong, whatever his name is,

399
00:24:45,738 --> 00:24:46,908
he is too tight-lipped.

400
00:24:48,448 --> 00:24:49,448
Nam...

401
00:24:49,508 --> 00:24:50,878
Nam Goong who?

402
00:24:51,978 --> 00:24:55,648
What? Nam? Why? Who?

403
00:24:55,718 --> 00:24:57,558
Hold on.

404
00:24:57,618 --> 00:24:59,888
Yes, hello? Yes.

405
00:24:59,958 --> 00:25:02,558
Now that you mention it, yes, it was today, right?

406
00:25:02,628 --> 00:25:04,358
Oh, understood, I will be right there.

407
00:25:04,428 --> 00:25:06,428
Yes. Hey, what should we do?

408
00:25:06,498 --> 00:25:07,898
I forgot about my meeting with the film company.

409
00:25:07,968 --> 00:25:09,568
Should I call Su Dong at least?

410
00:25:09,628 --> 00:25:11,838
Look, there are so many people here.

411
00:25:11,898 --> 00:25:13,838
Do not worry, nothing dangerous will happen.

412
00:25:13,898 --> 00:25:14,908
Not that.

413
00:25:14,968 --> 00:25:16,538
I am worried you will get into another power struggle...

414
00:25:16,608 --> 00:25:17,808
with the director here like last time.

415
00:25:17,878 --> 00:25:19,878
Why did you squeeze his hand so hard during the handshake?

416
00:25:19,938 --> 00:25:21,478
That is because...

417
00:25:21,548 --> 00:25:23,678
I have been working out intensely lately.

418
00:25:23,748 --> 00:25:25,848
Working out, my foot. Is breathing considered a workout?

419
00:25:25,918 --> 00:25:28,218
It was so pathetic to watch. He basically toyed with you.

420
00:25:28,288 --> 00:25:30,048
What? No, he did not.

421
00:25:30,118 --> 00:25:31,118
You looked like you were struggling.

422
00:25:31,188 --> 00:25:33,858
- I really was not.
- Seriously?

423
00:25:33,918 --> 00:25:35,328
Actor Um Tae Bong.

424
00:25:39,198 --> 00:25:41,028
I apologize, but I have urgent business to attend to right now.

425
00:25:41,098 --> 00:25:42,128
Please take good care of him.

426
00:25:58,548 --> 00:26:03,688
Under no circumstances are you allowed in my room.

427
00:26:03,748 --> 00:26:07,758
Oh, right. I will not go in. Who said I was curious anyway?

428
00:26:07,828 --> 00:26:08,928
I mean, it is just a room...

429
00:26:08,988 --> 00:26:11,198
How different could it be? What?

430
00:26:11,258 --> 00:26:12,598
Just because I grabbed the doorknob like this,

431
00:26:12,658 --> 00:26:13,898
does it mean I will turn it?

432
00:26:13,958 --> 00:26:15,698
And if I turn it, does it mean I will go in?

433
00:26:17,598 --> 00:26:20,908
Oh my, I guess I came in. Into this room.

434
00:26:23,968 --> 00:26:26,508
Why is this room as big as a playground?

435
00:26:32,318 --> 00:26:34,178
That look in your eyes.

436
00:26:34,248 --> 00:26:37,788
Sneaking into a room when the owner is not here,

437
00:26:37,858 --> 00:26:41,228
asking me what on earth I am doing, that is the look you are giving me.

438
00:26:41,288 --> 00:26:42,988
But...

439
00:26:43,058 --> 00:26:45,728
you do not seem unfamiliar.

440
00:26:56,808 --> 00:26:59,538
He sleeps alone, but the bed is huge.

441
00:26:59,608 --> 00:27:02,108
Does he think he is the pioneer of luxury and waste?

442
00:27:04,048 --> 00:27:08,118
Anyway, this is really nice.

443
00:27:12,158 --> 00:27:13,418
This cosiness.

444
00:27:16,328 --> 00:27:18,158
Why does it feel so familiar?

445
00:27:19,528 --> 00:27:23,428
It is like falling asleep like this...

446
00:27:26,198 --> 00:27:28,538
And so...

447
00:27:28,608 --> 00:27:31,008
feeling incredibly lonely...

448
00:27:33,408 --> 00:27:35,048
Welcome back, Chairman.

449
00:27:35,108 --> 00:27:40,018
- Like I was always alone...
- The young lady is not asleep yet.

450
00:27:41,148 --> 00:27:42,288
I will see her later.

451
00:27:45,288 --> 00:27:46,518
What is this?

452
00:27:47,618 --> 00:27:49,458
Is there an underground water vein flowing under the bed or something?

453
00:27:49,528 --> 00:27:52,928
No, why are these strange words suddenly coming to mind?

454
00:27:54,898 --> 00:27:58,998
Could this be Um Tae Bong's curse?

455
00:28:06,738 --> 00:28:10,008
- Hello?
- I just got a call from the CEO,

456
00:28:10,078 --> 00:28:11,648
telling me to hurry and join his meeting.

457
00:28:14,018 --> 00:28:15,788
But I cannot go.

458
00:28:15,848 --> 00:28:17,788
I am here at the broadcasting station...

459
00:28:17,858 --> 00:28:19,188
to coordinate the filming schedule with the AD.

460
00:28:19,258 --> 00:28:21,288
You are the bodyguard, not me.

461
00:28:24,228 --> 00:28:25,298
Look at this, look at this.

462
00:28:25,358 --> 00:28:28,598
Cha Hong Du is the only one slacking off again today, just her.

463
00:28:28,668 --> 00:28:29,968
I am certain...

464
00:28:30,028 --> 00:28:31,668
he is being blackmailed by her with some weakness.

465
00:28:31,738 --> 00:28:33,968
- Weakness?
- Actually...

466
00:28:35,708 --> 00:28:36,968
I heard something.

467
00:28:40,638 --> 00:28:43,478
Your life as a romance actor is dead.

468
00:28:43,548 --> 00:28:45,278
And that is...

469
00:28:45,348 --> 00:28:47,618
a fatal flaw as a man, too.

470
00:28:47,678 --> 00:28:48,688
Flaw?

471
00:28:50,988 --> 00:28:51,988
When I heard that,

472
00:28:52,058 --> 00:28:54,788
I should have used that weakness against him myself.

473
00:28:54,858 --> 00:28:57,528
Did you not say love cannot just move on?

474
00:28:57,588 --> 00:28:59,398
I thought you had become a decent person for a second.

475
00:29:03,698 --> 00:29:07,068
I am doing this because of love, too.

476
00:29:07,138 --> 00:29:08,968
Cha Hong Du caught his weakness,

477
00:29:09,038 --> 00:29:11,138
so she is the only one getting special treatment.

478
00:29:12,808 --> 00:29:14,338
Do not mess with Hong Du.

479
00:29:14,408 --> 00:29:16,748
She gives her heart away too easily, you know?

480
00:29:16,808 --> 00:29:19,078
She cries easily and laughs easily.

481
00:29:19,148 --> 00:29:20,278
It makes me feel bad for her.

482
00:29:26,158 --> 00:29:29,828
Why do you feel bad for her? I am the most pitiful one,

483
00:29:29,888 --> 00:29:31,958
getting extorted by my mom every single day.

484
00:29:32,028 --> 00:29:33,728
Wait a minute,

485
00:29:33,798 --> 00:29:35,568
does that mean...

486
00:29:35,628 --> 00:29:38,268
Um Tae Bong's house is empty right now?

487
00:29:45,538 --> 00:29:47,338
Move the bottom part up this way a little.

488
00:29:48,508 --> 00:29:51,778
Come to think of it, that jerk's name was Han Jung Woo, too.

489
00:29:51,848 --> 00:29:53,618
Why is that name so common?

490
00:29:54,888 --> 00:29:57,118
It is almost as if the Han Jung Woo from that drama...

491
00:29:57,188 --> 00:29:59,788
was modelled after him.

492
00:30:02,328 --> 00:30:03,528
He basically toyed with you.

493
00:30:09,168 --> 00:30:10,228
(BK001 Limited Edition Buyers' Private Party Proposal)

494
00:30:11,968 --> 00:30:13,398
After the commercial shoot,

495
00:30:13,468 --> 00:30:16,308
we plan to host a private party exclusively for buyers of...

496
00:30:16,368 --> 00:30:18,138
the new car's limited edition.

497
00:30:18,208 --> 00:30:21,008
A charity auction is also included in the event.

498
00:30:21,078 --> 00:30:24,078
- A charity auction?
- All the collected donations...

499
00:30:24,148 --> 00:30:25,978
will be delivered to an international relief organisation.

500
00:30:27,348 --> 00:30:28,848
So my job there is...

501
00:30:28,918 --> 00:30:30,548
rather than how to make a lot of money,

502
00:30:30,618 --> 00:30:33,388
to stand in front of rich people who worry about where to spend it,

503
00:30:33,458 --> 00:30:35,128
listen to speeches about the changing global situation...

504
00:30:35,188 --> 00:30:38,298
and unstable overseas stock markets, for a couple of hours,

505
00:30:38,358 --> 00:30:39,828
agree with their gossip about the hottest celebrities...

506
00:30:39,898 --> 00:30:42,968
to get on their good side, and basically...

507
00:30:43,028 --> 00:30:46,968
be the pretty face that rakes in the money?

508
00:30:50,538 --> 00:30:51,738
Not quite.

509
00:30:51,808 --> 00:30:54,008
I was asking you to make a donation yourself.

510
00:30:55,278 --> 00:30:57,918
- A talent donation.
- A what donation?

511
00:30:57,978 --> 00:31:00,848
When they only want to open one pocket,

512
00:31:00,918 --> 00:31:02,988
I want you to use your magic...

513
00:31:03,048 --> 00:31:05,318
- to make them open both.
- Magic?

514
00:31:05,388 --> 00:31:08,188
I would like to auction off a dinner with Um Tae Bong.

515
00:31:08,258 --> 00:31:11,558
You are putting a price tag on a dinner with me.

516
00:31:11,628 --> 00:31:14,228
However, it seems you have run into one small problem recently.

517
00:31:14,298 --> 00:31:16,698
The incident where you left the set the other day.

518
00:31:16,768 --> 00:31:18,138
Because of that, the issue of Actor Um's...

519
00:31:18,198 --> 00:31:21,568
arrogant personality has surfaced again.

520
00:31:23,138 --> 00:31:26,108
You have many devoted fans, but you also have many haters,

521
00:31:26,178 --> 00:31:27,948
so we are deeply concerned that...

522
00:31:28,008 --> 00:31:29,148
it might cause some noise at this event...

523
00:31:31,108 --> 00:31:33,418
Na Hoon A, the godfather of the entertainment industry,

524
00:31:33,478 --> 00:31:35,218
once said this.

525
00:31:35,218 --> 00:31:37,688
A true superstar...

526
00:31:37,748 --> 00:31:41,728
must drive both their fans and their haters...

527
00:31:41,788 --> 00:31:46,558
crazy at the same time. A star who only has devoted fans...

528
00:31:47,998 --> 00:31:49,898
has no charm.

529
00:31:56,468 --> 00:32:00,738
- Why look at me like that?
- Between a fan and a hater,

530
00:32:01,948 --> 00:32:04,848
I was wondering which line I should stand in...

531
00:32:05,848 --> 00:32:07,348
for Um Tae Bong.

532
00:32:08,518 --> 00:32:10,248
Unbelievable.

533
00:32:10,318 --> 00:32:12,018
I will take responsibility for that.

534
00:32:12,088 --> 00:32:13,088
Right.

535
00:32:20,658 --> 00:32:21,668
Please sign here...

536
00:32:23,728 --> 00:32:27,598
- I have not made a decision yet.
- That cautiousness,

537
00:32:27,668 --> 00:32:29,138
the more I see it, the more it is my style.

538
00:32:32,338 --> 00:32:34,438
I just hope our taste in women does not overlap.

539
00:32:36,148 --> 00:32:39,218
That will never happen.

540
00:32:39,278 --> 00:32:43,118
Because my standards are incredibly high.

541
00:32:51,428 --> 00:32:53,028
Where did it go?

542
00:32:53,098 --> 00:32:55,898
If they do not overlap, that is a relief for me.

543
00:32:58,338 --> 00:32:59,398
Excuse me for a moment.

544
00:33:01,938 --> 00:33:03,068
(Cha Hong Du)

545
00:33:05,678 --> 00:33:06,978
Yes, what is it?

546
00:33:07,038 --> 00:33:11,048
I am in a taxi on my way to you,

547
00:33:11,108 --> 00:33:14,948
and I think I left my motion sickness pills at home.

548
00:33:15,018 --> 00:33:16,348
What?

549
00:33:16,418 --> 00:33:18,888
I really cannot breathe.

550
00:33:18,958 --> 00:33:21,558
Um Tae Bong, help me.

551
00:33:23,458 --> 00:33:24,458
Wait.

552
00:33:30,628 --> 00:33:32,138
Excuse me, by any chance,

553
00:33:33,768 --> 00:33:35,368
is there an empty room...

554
00:33:36,368 --> 00:33:37,808
I can use?

555
00:33:41,308 --> 00:33:45,048
Tears are welling up so I lift my head

556
00:33:45,118 --> 00:33:48,488
And smile a little more so they do not fall

557
00:33:48,548 --> 00:33:52,318
Why are you doing this to me what are you saying

558
00:33:52,388 --> 00:33:56,288
All the words you said today up to the sky

559
00:33:56,358 --> 00:33:59,128
- The words I could never say - He is singing?

560
00:34:00,428 --> 00:34:04,598
The words I did not know I would say while crying

561
00:34:04,668 --> 00:34:08,668
I like you

562
00:34:08,738 --> 00:34:12,438
So much

563
00:34:12,508 --> 00:34:15,248
Oh my, one, two!

564
00:34:15,308 --> 00:34:18,618
I am in my dream

565
00:34:22,718 --> 00:34:24,218
Oh, man.

566
00:34:25,358 --> 00:34:26,988
This is not singing, it sounds like a pig being...

567
00:34:27,058 --> 00:34:30,028
Anyway, he has been doing that for 15 minutes already.

568
00:34:30,088 --> 00:34:32,258
Why on earth? Did he suddenly go crazy?

569
00:34:32,328 --> 00:34:33,828
I mean, why do this in someone else's company?

570
00:34:33,898 --> 00:34:35,728
Why? It sounds good to me.

571
00:34:36,928 --> 00:34:38,138
That does?

572
00:34:38,198 --> 00:34:40,438
He must have received a mission from his girlfriend.

573
00:34:40,498 --> 00:34:42,408
I heard he was caught up in dating rumours, too.

574
00:34:42,468 --> 00:34:44,068
Um Tae Bong...

575
00:34:44,138 --> 00:34:46,008
seems to be more romantic than I thought.

576
00:34:48,378 --> 00:34:50,148
You do not have to sing anymore.

577
00:34:50,208 --> 00:34:51,848
I have arrived, where should I go?

578
00:34:53,048 --> 00:34:55,318
- Yes, Chairman.
- Where are you right now?

579
00:34:55,388 --> 00:34:56,988
I am still at the office.

580
00:34:57,048 --> 00:34:59,318
That neighbourhood where Hae Ra was caught on CCTV,

581
00:34:59,388 --> 00:35:00,988
I would like you to go there yourself.

582
00:35:02,088 --> 00:35:03,688
I have already checked everything there...

583
00:35:08,928 --> 00:35:13,668
- How is Ms. Hae Ra here...
- Did you just say Hae Ra?

584
00:35:14,668 --> 00:35:16,108
Excuse me?

585
00:35:16,168 --> 00:35:17,838
No, I did not.

586
00:35:17,908 --> 00:35:20,008
- Where are you right now, Chairman?
- I am in the lobby.

587
00:35:36,328 --> 00:35:37,858
Chairman, I will come escort you.

588
00:36:02,648 --> 00:36:04,688
Why is everyone here?

589
00:36:07,188 --> 00:36:09,658
Oh, here.

590
00:36:09,728 --> 00:36:12,028
My stylist is here.

591
00:36:12,098 --> 00:36:13,098
Hong Du.

592
00:36:15,628 --> 00:36:17,198
What?

593
00:36:17,268 --> 00:36:18,598
Jung Woo?

594
00:36:18,668 --> 00:36:19,968
So you are...

595
00:36:26,878 --> 00:36:29,748
Um Tae Bong's secret bodyguard.

596
00:36:29,808 --> 00:36:32,318
What? The number of people who know that...

597
00:36:32,378 --> 00:36:33,378
just increased by one a second ago...

598
00:36:33,448 --> 00:36:34,888
So that secret of yours...

599
00:36:34,948 --> 00:36:37,618
will not be able to complete its mission anymore?

600
00:36:41,058 --> 00:36:43,128
I am sorry, I did not mean to intrude.

601
00:36:43,188 --> 00:36:44,688
Anyway, I will also participate...

602
00:36:44,758 --> 00:36:47,698
- in keeping this secret.
- Wow. Do whatever you want.

603
00:36:47,758 --> 00:36:49,268
This is surprising.

604
00:36:49,328 --> 00:36:50,668
To think you two are connected like this...

605
00:36:53,938 --> 00:36:55,068
Oh, then...

606
00:36:55,138 --> 00:36:57,868
The employer I talked to on the phone back then...

607
00:37:05,118 --> 00:37:08,448
The one who broadcasted her washing up live...

608
00:37:09,688 --> 00:37:11,448
Him?

609
00:37:11,518 --> 00:37:14,818
Wait, you two know each other too?

610
00:37:14,888 --> 00:37:16,858
- How?
- Then are you two...

611
00:37:16,928 --> 00:37:19,598
- still living in the same house?
- Oh, not just the two of us,

612
00:37:19,658 --> 00:37:21,828
but three of us including my father...

613
00:37:21,898 --> 00:37:24,398
So you two lived in the rooftop room?

614
00:37:24,468 --> 00:37:25,968
As very close...

615
00:37:26,038 --> 00:37:27,698
neighbours?

616
00:37:27,768 --> 00:37:29,468
Oh, what about it?

617
00:37:29,538 --> 00:37:32,378
But what kind of danger are you guarding him from?

618
00:37:34,108 --> 00:37:35,708
It does not look like there is anything dangerous.

619
00:37:37,208 --> 00:37:40,048
Oh, well, well, what kind of danger it is...

620
00:37:40,118 --> 00:37:41,378
It is a bit...

621
00:37:41,448 --> 00:37:42,888
This is too dangerous.

622
00:37:42,948 --> 00:37:44,448
I almost burned the roof of my mouth earlier.

623
00:37:51,358 --> 00:37:52,998
This is also too dangerous.

624
00:37:53,058 --> 00:37:55,268
- I almost cut my finger and bled.
- Oh, really?

625
00:37:58,768 --> 00:37:59,838
Knock it off.

626
00:38:04,708 --> 00:38:05,938
Anyway,

627
00:38:06,578 --> 00:38:07,638
did you know?

628
00:38:07,708 --> 00:38:10,548
My house is smaller than other celebrities' houses.

629
00:38:10,608 --> 00:38:14,318
Especially since the walls are so thin,

630
00:38:14,378 --> 00:38:17,688
you can hear everything from coughing to farting.

631
00:38:17,688 --> 00:38:20,288
Sometimes, how should I put it?

632
00:38:25,158 --> 00:38:28,768
It feels like we are sleeping in the same room.

633
00:38:32,398 --> 00:38:34,438
- Excuse me, Hong Du.
- Yes?

634
00:38:34,498 --> 00:38:35,838
Do you happen to need earplugs?

635
00:38:37,468 --> 00:38:39,108
Are you worrying about me right now?

636
00:38:42,808 --> 00:38:45,078
The point of what I am saying is not that.

637
00:38:45,148 --> 00:38:46,348
Seriously, man.

638
00:38:47,378 --> 00:38:51,688
Are you the type who cannot understand what people are saying?

639
00:38:51,758 --> 00:38:55,028
- I mean, this woman and I...
- I am sorry.

640
00:38:55,088 --> 00:38:57,788
It has only been a few days since I came from abroad.

641
00:38:57,858 --> 00:39:00,428
Do you not know that you are beating around the bush?

642
00:39:01,868 --> 00:39:04,298
Whose side are you on?

643
00:39:04,968 --> 00:39:06,738
Stay outside.

644
00:39:06,798 --> 00:39:08,668
- What did you say?
- Stay outside.

645
00:39:18,448 --> 00:39:20,018
How is it?

646
00:39:20,078 --> 00:39:21,248
Can you tell it is me?

647
00:39:22,518 --> 00:39:23,518
With you all covered up like that,

648
00:39:23,588 --> 00:39:25,188
how could anyone tell you are Song Na Ri?

649
00:39:25,258 --> 00:39:26,318
It is fine.

650
00:39:26,388 --> 00:39:28,688
Oh, you really do not know anything.

651
00:39:30,188 --> 00:39:33,228
Do you not see all those people staring?

652
00:39:38,368 --> 00:39:39,998
You saw them, right?

653
00:39:40,068 --> 00:39:41,938
Why do you think celebrities insist on wearing...

654
00:39:42,008 --> 00:39:45,038
such huge sunglasses even in the dead of night?

655
00:39:45,108 --> 00:39:46,708
Do you think they actually want to hide?

656
00:39:46,778 --> 00:39:48,208
Well, no.

657
00:39:48,278 --> 00:39:51,818
It is actually their way of saying, "I am a celebrity."

658
00:39:51,878 --> 00:39:53,378
They are advertising themselves.

659
00:39:53,448 --> 00:39:55,288
That is why people call them attention seekers.

660
00:39:55,348 --> 00:39:58,588
What's wrong with seeking it? Malicious commenters are worse.

661
00:40:00,218 --> 00:40:01,758
Anyway, what are you suddenly trying to buy?

662
00:40:03,058 --> 00:40:04,488
It is a secret.

663
00:40:04,558 --> 00:40:06,528
Yes, I am Song Na Ri.

664
00:40:14,698 --> 00:40:16,008
That is a shame.

665
00:40:16,068 --> 00:40:17,508
I can only hope you change your mind.

666
00:40:18,808 --> 00:40:20,908
That is not going to happen.

667
00:40:20,978 --> 00:40:22,548
So you are saying you will not do it...

668
00:40:25,948 --> 00:40:29,488
Our company even sponsored your drama before.

669
00:40:29,548 --> 00:40:30,988
You know the one.

670
00:40:31,048 --> 00:40:33,388
- The Crown Prince's...
- Oh my gosh.

671
00:40:34,558 --> 00:40:38,428
Right, BK was the sponsor back then, and we filmed here too.

672
00:40:38,498 --> 00:40:40,258
Then according to her delusion,

673
00:40:40,328 --> 00:40:41,868
I am supposed to be the heir to this company.

674
00:40:41,928 --> 00:40:42,928
Are you done?

675
00:40:42,998 --> 00:40:44,598
Oh, right, this is your company, is it not?

676
00:40:44,668 --> 00:40:45,668
Excuse me?

677
00:40:47,238 --> 00:40:48,238
Did you not know?

678
00:40:48,298 --> 00:40:51,268
- Um Tae Bong here is the ow...
- The owner, yes.

679
00:40:52,878 --> 00:40:54,578
What I mean is...

680
00:40:54,638 --> 00:40:56,978
I have a very strong sense of ownership,

681
00:40:57,048 --> 00:40:59,248
and the model is essentially the owner of the brand.

682
00:40:59,318 --> 00:41:03,748
I will do it. I will do that talent donation.

683
00:41:06,818 --> 00:41:09,688
You changed your mind so quickly. Anyway, that is great news.

684
00:41:10,728 --> 00:41:12,158
He keeps flipping back and forth.

685
00:41:12,228 --> 00:41:16,198
- Acting like he is the owner.
- Come on. This guy right here...

686
00:41:16,268 --> 00:41:21,698
- is the chairman's son.
- The flower of our company.

687
00:41:21,768 --> 00:41:25,508
An eternal flame that never goes out.

688
00:41:25,578 --> 00:41:28,208
- You mean me?
- Yes.

689
00:41:28,278 --> 00:41:31,378
I neglected the company a lot since entering entertainment,

690
00:41:31,448 --> 00:41:33,948
but having someone as excellent as you, Mr. Na,

691
00:41:34,018 --> 00:41:37,388
takes a huge weight off my shoulders.

692
00:41:37,448 --> 00:41:40,118
You will keep up the hard work, right?

693
00:41:40,188 --> 00:41:41,188
Excuse me?

694
00:41:43,758 --> 00:41:45,428
- Yes.
- Right.

695
00:41:45,758 --> 00:41:47,428
Are you not coming?

696
00:41:47,498 --> 00:41:48,628
Oh, hold on.

697
00:41:48,698 --> 00:41:50,898
Jung Woo, let us go ride bicycles again this weekend.

698
00:41:50,968 --> 00:41:52,538
Um Tae Bong does not have any schedules that day.

699
00:41:52,598 --> 00:41:54,198
Unbelievable.

700
00:41:54,268 --> 00:41:56,608
- What is with her pronunciation?
- Shall we?

701
00:41:56,668 --> 00:41:58,678
There are so many other things besides cycling...

702
00:41:58,738 --> 00:42:00,508
that I want to teach you, Hong Du.

703
00:42:00,578 --> 00:42:03,108
Really? I would love that.

704
00:42:03,178 --> 00:42:04,578
Unbelievable.

705
00:42:04,648 --> 00:42:06,518
Look at them making heart eyes at each other.

706
00:42:06,578 --> 00:42:09,788
- Are you coming or not?
- What? I am coming.

707
00:42:09,848 --> 00:42:10,848
I will get going now.

708
00:42:13,588 --> 00:42:15,488
They seem closer than just colleagues, right?

709
00:42:16,728 --> 00:42:19,028
I heard celebrities often disguise their lovers as a stylist...

710
00:42:19,098 --> 00:42:21,098
or a manager to fool people.

711
00:42:21,158 --> 00:42:23,528
Do you think the person who sang earlier...

712
00:42:23,598 --> 00:42:26,038
might have been her? I just have a strong feeling.

713
00:42:27,338 --> 00:42:30,108
Wow, a heart.

714
00:42:30,168 --> 00:42:31,738
Manager Na.

715
00:42:31,808 --> 00:42:33,108
You said you were the spark of our company, right?

716
00:42:35,548 --> 00:42:36,978
Let us see you burn that spark today.

717
00:42:38,748 --> 00:42:39,978
All right, our team is working overtime today.

718
00:42:42,348 --> 00:42:43,948
Who gave you permission to make plans?

719
00:42:44,988 --> 00:42:47,158
You probably have a schedule that day.

720
00:42:47,218 --> 00:42:49,088
Wow, that is so petty.

721
00:42:49,158 --> 00:42:51,488
I already checked, and I have nothing scheduled that day.

722
00:42:51,558 --> 00:42:52,758
Then what about your father?

723
00:42:52,828 --> 00:42:56,098
You were so desperate to find him, gosh.

724
00:42:56,168 --> 00:42:58,638
Then I can just bring my father along.

725
00:42:58,698 --> 00:42:59,998
No, what I mean is...

726
00:43:02,008 --> 00:43:04,508
Anyway, because of you today,

727
00:43:04,568 --> 00:43:08,878
- I even had to sing, - Oh, I am sorry about that.

728
00:43:08,948 --> 00:43:11,808
And you promised a talent donation that I did not even have to do.

729
00:43:11,878 --> 00:43:13,818
It is for your company, so why is that my fault?

730
00:43:13,878 --> 00:43:15,518
It is your fault, entirely your fault.

731
00:43:16,618 --> 00:43:21,188
Well, it is for my company, but business is a separate matter.

732
00:43:21,258 --> 00:43:22,928
If you had not come here and hyped it up,

733
00:43:22,988 --> 00:43:24,428
I would not have done it for free.

734
00:43:24,488 --> 00:43:26,258
If I make decisions without consulting him,

735
00:43:26,328 --> 00:43:28,698
what position does that put CEO Park in?

736
00:43:28,768 --> 00:43:30,098
Oh, is that so?

737
00:43:31,428 --> 00:43:32,438
Sorry.

738
00:43:36,068 --> 00:43:37,508
Oh, I will be right back after a quick phone call.

739
00:43:37,568 --> 00:43:38,568
Okay.

740
00:43:54,188 --> 00:43:55,528
I grabbed it first.

741
00:43:56,688 --> 00:44:00,458
I was exactly 0.1 seconds faster. From the moment I walked in,

742
00:44:00,528 --> 00:44:02,228
I already had my eyes on this outfit.

743
00:44:04,768 --> 00:44:06,298
Excuse me, maybe you do not know...

744
00:44:06,368 --> 00:44:09,168
- who I am...
- I know you, Song Na Ri.

745
00:44:09,238 --> 00:44:10,238
Well...

746
00:44:11,238 --> 00:44:14,378
You know me? Wait, even though you know me...

747
00:44:15,748 --> 00:44:18,548
Expecting celebrity privileges in a place like this...

748
00:44:18,608 --> 00:44:20,448
makes you look a bit cheap, does it not?

749
00:44:20,518 --> 00:44:23,718
Excuse me, who asked for celebrity privileges?

750
00:44:23,788 --> 00:44:27,288
You might not know this, but the hand is quicker than the eye.

751
00:44:27,358 --> 00:44:28,588
My really close friend, Cho Seung Woo,

752
00:44:28,658 --> 00:44:29,658
said that in a movie.

753
00:44:32,128 --> 00:44:34,358
I do not know about that line,

754
00:44:34,428 --> 00:44:36,798
but I do remember a famous line that Kim Hye Soo said in it.

755
00:44:38,398 --> 00:44:41,098
Look at this kid talking back. So disrespectful.

756
00:44:42,638 --> 00:44:44,238
What? Disrespectful?

757
00:44:47,608 --> 00:44:49,548
I have heard that insult as often as I eat meals,

758
00:44:49,608 --> 00:44:51,178
so it does not really work on me.

759
00:44:53,748 --> 00:44:56,348
- Excuse me.
- Yes.

760
00:44:56,418 --> 00:44:58,018
Please check the video replay for us.

761
00:44:59,158 --> 00:45:00,158
We do not install video replay systems...

762
00:45:00,218 --> 00:45:02,528
just to prepare for situations like this.

763
00:45:02,588 --> 00:45:04,388
Why do you not just have one of you yield...

764
00:45:06,228 --> 00:45:10,968
You grabbed the sleeve of the shirt. I grabbed the body of the shirt.

765
00:45:12,798 --> 00:45:15,268
Then there is really only one way to settle this.

766
00:45:15,338 --> 00:45:16,408
Please...

767
00:45:16,468 --> 00:45:17,508
- cut it in half.
- Cut it in half.

768
00:45:24,778 --> 00:45:26,148
I'm the one who stayed up for three nights straight,

769
00:45:26,218 --> 00:45:27,548
so why are you the one in a bad mood?

770
00:45:28,618 --> 00:45:30,988
I just got into a fight.

771
00:45:31,048 --> 00:45:33,488
- With some cheeky little brat.
- Cheeky?

772
00:45:33,558 --> 00:45:36,688
That's your area of expertise. Who dared to?

773
00:45:36,758 --> 00:45:40,228
Oh my, my inner voice was pretty loud, wasn't it?

774
00:45:40,298 --> 00:45:43,698
Anyway, who is this girl? The warrior who went toe-to-toe.

775
00:45:43,768 --> 00:45:45,598
There's this girl. A really stupid one.

776
00:45:46,998 --> 00:45:48,338
I mean, I called dibs on it first,

777
00:45:48,398 --> 00:45:50,538
but she insisted she picked it first.

778
00:45:50,608 --> 00:45:51,938
Gosh, unbelievable.

779
00:45:52,008 --> 00:45:54,308
Do you know how long I've had my eye on that?

780
00:45:56,948 --> 00:45:58,918
Are you seeing someone?

781
00:46:00,018 --> 00:46:03,548
My gut says it's been a while since you met him,

782
00:46:03,618 --> 00:46:06,188
but you haven't made it to the dating stage yet.

783
00:46:07,758 --> 00:46:08,758
What are you talking about?

784
00:46:09,788 --> 00:46:12,198
Writing is all about observing people.

785
00:46:12,258 --> 00:46:13,898
You should try this job. You'd be a psychic.

786
00:46:15,298 --> 00:46:17,668
Then you should roll that mat right back up.

787
00:46:17,728 --> 00:46:18,898
It's not a man.

788
00:46:18,968 --> 00:46:20,598
Gosh, so what if it is?

789
00:46:20,668 --> 00:46:22,768
It's been three years since you let Min Seok go.

790
00:46:22,838 --> 00:46:26,438
Well, it's a shame it's not.

791
00:46:26,508 --> 00:46:29,278
The only time a person should be alone is in their coffin.

792
00:46:29,348 --> 00:46:32,048
Look at Song Na Ri. She did my drama,

793
00:46:32,118 --> 00:46:34,778
started dating Um Tae Bong, and now her eyes are just sparkling.

794
00:46:34,848 --> 00:46:36,448
Oh, you'd know Um Tae Bong better than me.

795
00:46:36,518 --> 00:46:38,288
He's been playing around with so many girls,

796
00:46:38,348 --> 00:46:41,288
so is Um Tae Bong finally settling down now?

797
00:46:46,328 --> 00:46:48,628
I heard you set a wedding date. With a doctor?

798
00:46:48,698 --> 00:46:50,828
I should bow down to Um Tae Bong.

799
00:46:50,898 --> 00:46:52,598
I mean, honestly, six months ago,

800
00:46:52,668 --> 00:46:54,398
after your dating scandal with Um Tae Bong broke,

801
00:46:54,468 --> 00:46:56,768
you got back in the spotlight and snagged a doctor.

802
00:46:56,838 --> 00:46:58,008
Bow down, my foot...

803
00:46:58,068 --> 00:47:01,108
- It was strictly business anyway.
- What?

804
00:47:01,178 --> 00:47:02,978
Actually, we were fake back then.

805
00:47:03,978 --> 00:47:06,218
Oh my, so that tabloid rumour was true?

806
00:47:06,278 --> 00:47:09,248
Not just me, but all the female celebrities Um Tae Bong dated...

807
00:47:09,318 --> 00:47:10,788
were all business relationships.

808
00:47:10,848 --> 00:47:12,518
I heard the one he's seeing now, Song Na Ri, is real.

809
00:47:12,588 --> 00:47:14,288
She's fake too, 100 percent.

810
00:47:14,358 --> 00:47:17,358
Hey, is it okay to just blab about this?

811
00:47:17,428 --> 00:47:19,528
Why should I care about that guy now?

812
00:47:19,598 --> 00:47:21,498
Whether rumours spread or not.

813
00:47:21,558 --> 00:47:22,798
Let's go.

814
00:47:22,868 --> 00:47:23,868
Let's go.

815
00:47:29,468 --> 00:47:31,408
- Hey.
- Yes.

816
00:47:31,468 --> 00:47:33,038
Let's do dinner next time.

817
00:47:33,108 --> 00:47:34,638
I think something urgent just came up.

818
00:47:37,348 --> 00:47:39,878
Hey, oh, man.

819
00:47:39,948 --> 00:47:41,948
I...

820
00:47:43,218 --> 00:47:45,718
I can't sing anymore. Seriously,

821
00:47:45,788 --> 00:47:47,518
I'm going to get vocal cord nodules, seriously.

822
00:47:48,718 --> 00:47:50,858
Your motion sickness should be fine for a bit.

823
00:47:50,928 --> 00:47:52,728
So rest your voice for a while.

824
00:47:52,798 --> 00:47:56,168
Yes, yes, thank you.

825
00:47:56,228 --> 00:48:00,168
Man, seriously, you really don't listen.

826
00:48:00,238 --> 00:48:02,808
It wasn't even dangerous earlier, but you just had to come.

827
00:48:02,868 --> 00:48:05,538
Well, I'm the person who protects you...

828
00:48:05,608 --> 00:48:06,738
anytime, anywhere.

829
00:48:07,738 --> 00:48:09,578
And yet you left the motion sickness pills behind?

830
00:48:09,648 --> 00:48:13,018
That is so Hong Du.

831
00:48:15,948 --> 00:48:18,588
So Hong Du. You do not know what it means?

832
00:48:18,648 --> 00:48:20,588
- I do not.
- What about "a great value?"

833
00:48:21,888 --> 00:48:24,058
How can you not know such an old catchphrase?

834
00:48:24,128 --> 00:48:26,358
When someone is generous like Kim Hye Ja...

835
00:48:26,428 --> 00:48:29,528
and it is highly cost-effective, it is a great value.

836
00:48:29,598 --> 00:48:32,338
Then what do you think "so Hong Du" means?

837
00:48:32,398 --> 00:48:33,398
Somehow,

838
00:48:34,498 --> 00:48:37,438
I feel like I am about to get very offended.

839
00:48:37,508 --> 00:48:39,678
Oh, you are weak with catchphrases,

840
00:48:39,738 --> 00:48:42,778
but your intuition is quite something.

841
00:48:42,848 --> 00:48:43,848
Gosh.

842
00:48:46,418 --> 00:48:47,418
But...

843
00:48:48,718 --> 00:48:51,118
how long are you planning to be my bodyguard?

844
00:48:54,558 --> 00:48:57,558
Until I feel that you are completely safe?

845
00:49:01,128 --> 00:49:04,068
Why do you ask all of a sudden?

846
00:49:09,468 --> 00:49:11,308
Song Na Ri posted on her social media.

847
00:49:11,368 --> 00:49:12,638
Take care of that first, quickly.

848
00:49:18,678 --> 00:49:20,378
Today is Tae Bong's real birthday.

849
00:49:20,448 --> 00:49:22,648
I wonder what face he will make when he sees the gift.

850
00:49:22,718 --> 00:49:24,548
I am so excited.

851
00:49:27,318 --> 00:49:29,158
I will drop you off at the subway station.

852
00:49:29,228 --> 00:49:30,358
You do not get subway sickness, right?

853
00:49:31,528 --> 00:49:34,028
Here, open it.

854
00:49:41,398 --> 00:49:42,408
What is it?

855
00:49:43,908 --> 00:49:47,938
What? Are these arm sleeves?

856
00:49:48,008 --> 00:49:50,248
My birthday gift prepared just for you.

857
00:49:50,308 --> 00:49:52,678
You could call it spoils of war from a fierce battle.

858
00:49:54,018 --> 00:49:56,388
Did someone die? Spoils of war.

859
00:49:56,448 --> 00:49:58,688
If you are going to give it to me, give me both.

860
00:49:58,748 --> 00:50:01,818
- What is with just one side?
- It is our couple item.

861
00:50:01,888 --> 00:50:03,888
Wear it on your left arm when you drive in the summer.

862
00:50:03,958 --> 00:50:06,658
Because your arm is precious. Just like my hair.

863
00:50:08,198 --> 00:50:09,228
Oh, wait.

864
00:50:09,298 --> 00:50:11,568
Let's just take a picture to post on social media.

865
00:50:11,628 --> 00:50:13,568
I absolutely hate taking pictures.

866
00:50:13,638 --> 00:50:15,468
- I am not taking one, never.
- Here, one, two, three.

867
00:50:17,638 --> 00:50:19,008
Oh my, it came out well.

868
00:50:19,078 --> 00:50:21,238
He said he would not take it, but his words...

869
00:50:21,308 --> 00:50:25,248
and actions are so different. That is so Tae Bong.

870
00:50:30,518 --> 00:50:32,118
Did I hear that wrong?

871
00:50:32,188 --> 00:50:33,788
I think someone was badmouthing you.

872
00:50:33,858 --> 00:50:35,728
Yes, you heard wrong.

873
00:50:39,558 --> 00:50:40,998
Anyway, I think the dating rumours with you...

874
00:50:41,058 --> 00:50:44,598
broke out at a good time. Since when do you think I liked you?

875
00:50:47,068 --> 00:50:49,238
Is this a quiz? What is the prize money?

876
00:50:49,308 --> 00:50:52,938
I never answer unless it is deposited into my bank account.

877
00:50:56,508 --> 00:50:58,848
Yes, your script is always so tattered.

878
00:50:58,908 --> 00:50:59,918
But...

879
00:51:02,178 --> 00:51:04,488
never let your heart get tattered.

880
00:51:05,518 --> 00:51:06,758
Since the moment you said that.

881
00:51:08,858 --> 00:51:10,958
I said that? Then I take it back.

882
00:51:11,028 --> 00:51:14,158
From now on, you need to get more tattered.

883
00:51:14,228 --> 00:51:17,168
Your mentality is on the level of Iron Man's armour.

884
00:51:17,228 --> 00:51:19,538
His mentality is even stronger.

885
00:51:19,598 --> 00:51:23,238
He gets angry all day, yet he still eats just fine.

886
00:51:23,308 --> 00:51:25,878
That is so Tae Bong.

887
00:51:27,508 --> 00:51:29,178
Oh, that fakeness, that is also so Tae Bong.

888
00:51:29,248 --> 00:51:30,678
Just so Tae Bong.

889
00:51:30,748 --> 00:51:33,718
Would you like to order, ma'am?

890
00:51:33,778 --> 00:51:35,548
Well, I...

891
00:51:35,618 --> 00:51:36,618
I mean...

892
00:51:38,248 --> 00:51:40,258
(180 Dollars)

893
00:51:41,258 --> 00:51:45,758
What's the cheapest thing you have here?

894
00:51:45,828 --> 00:51:47,158
Under ten dollars.

895
00:51:47,228 --> 00:51:48,898
Excuse me?

896
00:51:48,958 --> 00:51:50,868
Why did she follow me all the way here...

897
00:51:50,928 --> 00:51:52,128
I'm never going to pay for her.

898
00:51:58,038 --> 00:51:59,908
Oh, why does it feel like there are three of us...

899
00:51:59,978 --> 00:52:01,938
instead of two?

900
00:52:02,008 --> 00:52:03,778
I'm a huge fan.

901
00:52:03,848 --> 00:52:04,848
You're so pretty.

902
00:52:05,878 --> 00:52:07,378
I'll take your card, thank you.

903
00:52:07,378 --> 00:52:08,948
Hey, do you have 40 dollars?

904
00:52:09,018 --> 00:52:11,018
What restaurant charges over 50 dollars for the cheapest thing?

905
00:52:11,088 --> 00:52:12,688
Exactly. Why are you eating at a place like this...

906
00:52:12,758 --> 00:52:14,488
when you don't even have money?

907
00:52:14,558 --> 00:52:16,458
I thought I was going to die following you in a taxi...

908
00:52:16,528 --> 00:52:17,958
without motion sickness medicine.

909
00:52:18,028 --> 00:52:19,558
You think I wanted to come? I came...

910
00:52:21,328 --> 00:52:22,468
to protect you.

911
00:52:22,528 --> 00:52:24,628
Why don't you just announce it to the world?

912
00:52:24,698 --> 00:52:28,668
It wouldn't be weird at all if Song Na Ri saw you here.

913
00:52:28,738 --> 00:52:30,468
That's why I covered myself up.

914
00:52:32,978 --> 00:52:37,378
Only follow me when I say I need a bodyguard.

915
00:52:37,448 --> 00:52:39,108
Stop getting in my way.

916
00:52:40,348 --> 00:52:41,348
Getting in your way?

917
00:52:47,558 --> 00:52:50,758
Goodbye. Tae Bong.

918
00:52:50,828 --> 00:52:51,828
Let's go together.

919
00:52:56,828 --> 00:52:58,728
Well...

920
00:52:58,798 --> 00:53:02,438
I'm so sorry, but I don't have enough money.

921
00:53:02,508 --> 00:53:04,438
Is there any way I can pay it off with manual labour?

922
00:53:04,508 --> 00:53:07,378
Like washing dishes or something?

923
00:53:07,438 --> 00:53:09,708
The gentleman who just left paid for it.

924
00:53:09,778 --> 00:53:10,778
What?

925
00:53:15,278 --> 00:53:18,248
- The car is here.
- Oh, your car is here.

926
00:53:18,318 --> 00:53:21,318
So where should we go now? My place?

927
00:53:21,388 --> 00:53:22,988
Or yours?

928
00:53:23,058 --> 00:53:26,958
Gosh, oh my.

929
00:53:28,758 --> 00:53:30,098
Hold on a second.

930
00:53:30,168 --> 00:53:31,328
(Hyun Joo)

931
00:53:32,698 --> 00:53:33,698
Yes.

932
00:53:35,138 --> 00:53:36,238
What?

933
00:53:36,868 --> 00:53:38,138
Stay right there and wait.

934
00:53:40,878 --> 00:53:41,878
Tae Bong.

935
00:53:43,208 --> 00:53:46,148
Should I get in? Can I get in?

936
00:53:46,218 --> 00:53:47,218
Hey.

937
00:53:48,278 --> 00:53:49,288
I asked if I should get in.

938
00:53:49,348 --> 00:53:50,918
Don't pretend you can't hear me. Hey.

939
00:53:52,518 --> 00:53:53,758
Hey. Um Tae Bong!

940
00:54:04,898 --> 00:54:05,898
Excuse me.

941
00:54:12,008 --> 00:54:13,738
Are you her guardian?

942
00:54:13,808 --> 00:54:15,438
I mean, she almost hit someone,

943
00:54:15,508 --> 00:54:17,778
but she's just sitting in her car not moving.

944
00:54:17,848 --> 00:54:19,918
What? Aren't you...

945
00:54:19,978 --> 00:54:20,978
Oh, yes.

946
00:54:21,048 --> 00:54:22,118
I'll take care of the medical bills...

947
00:54:22,178 --> 00:54:24,888
- and compensation for damages.
- Oh, okay.

948
00:54:25,048 --> 00:54:27,118
- If you could wait over there...
- Oh, okay.

949
00:54:38,868 --> 00:54:41,038
- Tae Bong.
- Are you okay?

950
00:54:47,238 --> 00:54:48,638
Have you calmed down a bit?

951
00:54:49,778 --> 00:54:51,278
Wait, where's Dong Seok?

952
00:54:51,348 --> 00:54:53,648
Oh, Dong Seok...

953
00:54:53,718 --> 00:54:55,678
I am sorry.

954
00:54:55,748 --> 00:54:57,388
I was just so shocked earlier.

955
00:54:58,548 --> 00:55:00,158
Like a fool, you were the only one I could think of.

956
00:55:01,488 --> 00:55:03,628
I guess it was worse because of Min Seok.

957
00:55:03,688 --> 00:55:06,428
Seeing someone get hit by a car, and by my car, of all things.

958
00:55:08,328 --> 00:55:10,368
It was so, so scary.

959
00:55:11,898 --> 00:55:14,938
He was not hurt anywhere. He says he is fine.

960
00:55:14,998 --> 00:55:16,008
Really?

961
00:55:17,338 --> 00:55:18,338
That is a relief.

962
00:55:19,508 --> 00:55:21,038
If it were not for you...

963
00:55:21,108 --> 00:55:23,108
I would still be crying right now.

964
00:55:26,818 --> 00:55:29,588
It was like that back then, too. The day we first met.

965
00:55:30,788 --> 00:55:33,158
I had an accident and was having a mental breakdown that day, too,

966
00:55:33,218 --> 00:55:35,688
but you suddenly appeared and helped me.

967
00:55:35,758 --> 00:55:36,758
Do you remember?

968
00:55:41,058 --> 00:55:42,198
Oh, my neck.

969
00:55:43,698 --> 00:55:45,328
What is this?

970
00:55:45,398 --> 00:55:47,838
Wow, the back of the car is completely ruined. Oh, seriously.

971
00:55:47,898 --> 00:55:50,108
Hey, Miss, what are you going to do about this?

972
00:55:50,168 --> 00:55:52,568
I asked what you are going to do.

973
00:55:52,638 --> 00:55:56,578
Hey, Miss. You have to fix this.

974
00:55:56,648 --> 00:55:58,108
- Sir.
- Yes, who are you?

975
00:55:58,178 --> 00:55:59,878
I am sorry, please wait a moment.

976
00:55:59,948 --> 00:56:00,948
Yes.

977
00:56:06,158 --> 00:56:09,288
It is going to be fine.

978
00:56:09,358 --> 00:56:11,288
Shall I help you a bit?

979
00:56:12,488 --> 00:56:15,928
Yes, thank you. What do I do?

980
00:56:17,898 --> 00:56:19,498
How could I forget?

981
00:56:19,568 --> 00:56:21,438
You were wearing a yellow dress just like now,

982
00:56:21,498 --> 00:56:23,968
looking exactly like a scared little chick.

983
00:56:24,038 --> 00:56:25,038
Did I?

984
00:56:26,308 --> 00:56:27,778
How do you remember all of that?

985
00:56:31,078 --> 00:56:32,978
We had a lot of fun back then.

986
00:56:35,318 --> 00:56:39,348
We did. With Min Seok and Dong Seok,

987
00:56:39,418 --> 00:56:42,418
the four of us used to roam all over Itaewon every day.

988
00:56:43,428 --> 00:56:44,428
Right.

989
00:56:46,758 --> 00:56:49,528
When Min Seok confessed his feelings to me,

990
00:56:49,598 --> 00:56:51,668
I was a little surprised.

991
00:56:51,728 --> 00:56:53,538
I thought you were going to confess.

992
00:56:59,608 --> 00:57:00,778
I suppose.

993
00:57:00,838 --> 00:57:03,448
Dong Seok would be more reliable as a bodyguard.

994
00:57:04,808 --> 00:57:07,118
I guess Um Tae Bong does not need me anymore.

995
00:57:12,388 --> 00:57:14,018
Just someone in the way...

996
00:57:31,138 --> 00:57:32,838
Hello.

997
00:57:32,908 --> 00:57:34,538
Being able to talk about things like this freely.

998
00:57:35,608 --> 00:57:37,208
I must have gotten really comfortable.

999
00:57:43,088 --> 00:57:44,088
(Toxic Na Ri)

1000
00:57:45,618 --> 00:57:46,618
Wait a minute.

1001
00:57:49,388 --> 00:57:50,388
What is it?

1002
00:57:52,058 --> 00:57:53,698
Can you not even catch a taxi by yourself?

1003
00:57:54,698 --> 00:57:56,698
Just figure it out and get home safely.

1004
00:58:01,468 --> 00:58:02,468
Was that Song Na Ri?

1005
00:58:03,708 --> 00:58:04,708
Why?

1006
00:58:06,178 --> 00:58:07,178
It is nothing.

1007
00:58:08,808 --> 00:58:10,208
Why are you so in the way?

1008
00:58:10,278 --> 00:58:11,908
Stop that and go clean the second floor.

1009
00:58:11,978 --> 00:58:13,518
Yes, understood.

1010
00:58:25,828 --> 00:58:27,598
Why does she make me care so much?

1011
00:58:29,928 --> 00:58:31,368
Are you worried about Na Ri?

1012
00:58:32,528 --> 00:58:34,338
It is not like that.

1013
00:58:37,268 --> 00:58:38,268
It is raining.

1014
00:58:39,838 --> 00:58:40,838
Oh, it is.

1015
00:58:42,878 --> 00:58:44,178
The rain makes it so atmospheric.

1016
00:58:47,978 --> 00:58:51,618
It must be nice to be confessed to on a day like this, right?

1017
00:58:53,518 --> 00:58:55,088
She probably got back fine, right?

1018
00:58:55,158 --> 00:58:56,528
Actually,

1019
00:58:56,588 --> 00:58:59,288
I knew about it. Tae Bong, that you...

1020
00:59:00,358 --> 00:59:01,858
stepped aside for Min Seok.

1021
00:59:05,098 --> 00:59:06,738
Will she be okay without motion sickness medicine?

1022
00:59:10,208 --> 00:59:11,938
What?

1023
00:59:12,008 --> 00:59:13,578
Oh, hold on a second.

1024
00:59:20,778 --> 00:59:23,448
So...

1025
00:59:23,518 --> 00:59:25,818
Where I am right now is...

1026
00:59:25,888 --> 00:59:27,158
Well...

1027
00:59:30,028 --> 00:59:31,858
I don't know.

1028
00:59:31,928 --> 00:59:34,528
Just tell me any building you can see right now.

1029
00:59:34,598 --> 00:59:36,798
The place we ate at earlier was...

1030
00:59:36,868 --> 00:59:39,098
The Flat Table?

1031
00:59:39,168 --> 00:59:40,438
Yes, it was there.

1032
00:59:40,498 --> 00:59:41,698
Okay, stay right there and don't move.

1033
00:59:41,768 --> 00:59:42,798
I'll go there right now and...

1034
00:59:42,868 --> 00:59:44,168
Hello? Hello...

1035
00:59:45,708 --> 00:59:46,708
Mr. Han?

1036
00:59:50,278 --> 00:59:52,648
What, my battery is dead too.

1037
00:59:56,688 --> 00:59:58,518
Why am I being so Hong Du?

1038
01:00:01,618 --> 01:00:03,328
The person you are calling is unavailable,

1039
01:00:03,388 --> 01:00:04,958
and you are being connected to voicemail.

1040
01:00:08,828 --> 01:00:10,228
The phone is turned off.

1041
01:00:10,228 --> 01:00:13,068
After the beep, you will be connected to voicemail...

1042
01:00:14,368 --> 01:00:15,898
If you're worried about Song Na Ri...

1043
01:00:15,968 --> 01:00:17,708
I think I should get going.

1044
01:00:17,768 --> 01:00:19,608
We can talk later.

1045
01:00:19,678 --> 01:00:20,878
What? Tae Bong...

1046
01:00:31,518 --> 01:00:33,888
Unless she's a clueless idiot,

1047
01:00:33,888 --> 01:00:34,988
would she still be there?

1048
01:00:45,628 --> 01:00:46,638
Thank you.

1049
01:00:58,708 --> 01:01:01,978
Excuse me, which way is the subway station?

1050
01:01:02,048 --> 01:01:04,988
- There isn't one around here.
- Oh, then to Hannam-dong,

1051
01:01:05,048 --> 01:01:06,518
how long would it take to walk?

1052
01:01:06,588 --> 01:01:09,488
What? You won't be able to walk, it's too far.

1053
01:01:09,558 --> 01:01:10,958
I see...

1054
01:01:11,028 --> 01:01:12,058
Thank you.

1055
01:01:57,038 --> 01:01:58,808
Are you really a clueless idiot?

1056
01:02:00,738 --> 01:02:02,538
Did you come looking for me?

1057
01:02:02,608 --> 01:02:05,208
- Why?
- Because you're my bodyguard.

1058
01:02:06,948 --> 01:02:08,278
Don't leave my side.

1059
01:02:09,318 --> 01:02:10,318
I...

1060
01:02:12,648 --> 01:02:13,658
need you.

1061
01:02:22,458 --> 01:02:24,368
This might be a presumptuous question...

1062
01:02:25,768 --> 01:02:29,938
There's Hyun Bin or Kim Woo Bin, and many others,

1063
01:02:30,008 --> 01:02:32,268
so why did she specifically choose...

1064
01:02:32,338 --> 01:02:33,478
our Tae Bong?

1065
01:02:38,048 --> 01:02:39,108
That's probably because...

1066
01:02:41,448 --> 01:02:43,148
Are you watching?

1067
01:02:43,218 --> 01:02:44,248
Ghost?

1068
01:02:44,318 --> 01:02:47,618
You asked who said that back then, right?

1069
01:02:50,558 --> 01:02:53,158
No one had ever made the young lady smile...

1070
01:02:53,228 --> 01:02:55,128
until he did.

1071
01:02:58,128 --> 01:03:01,138
The person who is with the young lady right now...

1072
01:03:02,768 --> 01:03:04,568
It does not matter who it is.

1073
01:03:08,438 --> 01:03:09,778
Don't go anywhere anymore.

1074
01:03:12,108 --> 01:03:13,118
Just stay by my side.

1075
01:03:20,018 --> 01:03:21,758
Anyway, you're so clueless.

1076
01:03:22,758 --> 01:03:24,958
You're so...

1077
01:03:25,028 --> 01:03:26,128
Hong Du.

1078
01:03:27,528 --> 01:03:29,528
Didn't you say I was in your way earlier?

1079
01:03:29,598 --> 01:03:32,328
And you're being so Tae Bong.

1080
01:03:36,968 --> 01:03:37,968
It's raining a lot.

1081
01:03:40,778 --> 01:03:41,778
It is.

1082
01:03:45,808 --> 01:03:47,248
Let's go home.

1083
01:03:48,948 --> 01:03:50,348
Yes, let's go.

1084
01:03:53,458 --> 01:03:56,688
Oh my, that is so Hong Du, so Hong Du.

1085
01:03:56,758 --> 01:03:59,328
- Oh my, that is so Tae Bong, - And you are so Tae Bong.

1086
01:04:00,398 --> 01:04:02,258
Do you finally get...

1087
01:04:02,328 --> 01:04:04,268
what being Hong Du means?

1088
01:04:04,328 --> 01:04:07,238
- No, I do not know.
- No, I think you do know.

1089
01:04:07,298 --> 01:04:08,298
No, I do not know.

1090
01:04:19,748 --> 01:04:23,418
The person who is with the young lady right now...

1091
01:04:23,488 --> 01:04:25,318
It does not matter who it is.

1092
01:04:26,558 --> 01:04:28,318
The one person she must never meet again.

1093
01:04:29,688 --> 01:04:31,258
As long as it is not that person.

1094
01:04:37,828 --> 01:04:40,638
(Oh! My Guard)
